600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G9C/U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"603ebe2a-d9fa-403d-9efb-5e0d69f63476","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"色弱つらい……。","ts":"1622168091.339000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jjU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0abce7a-85be-462e-aeb3-245eb76141f2","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ですね。特に褐色の場合、注意です。鮮血なら直腸付近の可能性もありますが……。","ts":"1622168085.338700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s8hV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0e9976a-0ff2-4882-b944-fe0e82960eea","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ちなみにどうでもいいけど、色弱だと血便がでても、色がわからないから気付きにくいんですよね…","ts":"1622168079.338600","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1622168086.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OmhLr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bec82b4-ac65-4a75-9cef-8ace687942a5","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"血便、痔じゃなければ即入院の可能性もあるので、急いだほうがいいです","ts":"1622168007.337300","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1622168020.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"63A2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37b1dbd0-51bb-469f-96a3-e5f8f35be56a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ええ、行った方がいいです……。お大事に……。","ts":"1622167084.336700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ry2f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e98a1b1e-b4ac-4854-b82a-b50879ccf4b1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"最近病院多い…","ts":"1622166957.336200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1V4uo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1435b7b3-6130-4b3c-858a-133c68e9cc47","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"病院行こうと思います","ts":"1622166951.